Recommends: mpv, fonts-noto-color-emoji, ffmpeg
Description: client for the MAX messenger, large and simple
 Сообщения (Messages) is an unofficial GTK client for MAX: chats and
 channels in large, calm type, photos, voice messages, reactions,
 forwarding and saving files. It lives in the background to receive
 messages. Part of Haltia, a calm touch desktop; it runs on any GTK desktop.
 .
 MAX's terms forbid third-party clients and MAX may block an account that
 uses one: use it at your own risk, only for your own account.
 .
 PyMax (maxapi-python, MIT) is included under /usr/lib/haltia-messenger,
 with the newer Python packages it needs where the distribution has older
 ones.
